7 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Thank you for the appeal! I'd love a cute artwork of my VTuber!\n\nShe has blue sparkly eyes. Her hair is pastel pink with pastel blue highlights! She has blue flowers in her hair. She has a big rabbit tail! She also has fangs. Her rabbit ears have stars in them! She has very pale skin, she is petite, small and cute and doll-like! She has a small chest size. She looks cute and princess-like but she's a spoiled and crazy girl!\n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/WESbeiy", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@R_am_mu/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3004108, "client_id": 3256422, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5fed0534/uploads/origins/e081dd00-fdf3-4310-8bac-4efde388dbc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90aac3a2944c36fc5b2c5d8c92fbcb4f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5fed0534/uploads/origins/e081dd00-fdf3-4310-8bac-4efde388dbc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90aac3a2944c36fc5b2c5d8c92fbcb4f, https://si.imgix.net/5fed0534/uploads/origins/e081dd00-fdf3-4310-8bac-4efde388dbc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=deeb746868726699c61d691791e80e67 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5fed0534/uploads/origins/e081dd00-fdf3-4310-8bac-4efde388dbc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56414eda804cad07b61ce5ba2fa8a5c5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5fed0534/uploads/origins/e081dd00-fdf3-4310-8bac-4efde388dbc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=37af3a21fdafa3e3fb4395e519aa3628", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5fed0534/uploads/origins/e081dd00-fdf3-4310-8bac-4